#    = 0 mod 4096 for n = 11).  Each dump line is "g6 n m D f alpha r"; the
#    Python reference recomputes all values and networkx recomputes the
#    parse, connectivity, D, alpha and the acyclicity of the forest witness.
#    The samples are not committed (regenerated by the conn / conn11 stages):
